     A          R HAMENU
     A                                  1  2'Help - Administration'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  3  3'Type a number and press Enter, or -
     A                                      put the cursor on a line and press -
     A                                      Enter.'
     A                                  5  3' 1  Users: enroll, change, disable-
     A                                       and remove office users.'
     A                                  6  3' 2  Groups: distribution lists for-
     A                                       messages and mail.'
     A                                  7  3' 3  Activity log: who did what, an-
     A                                      d when.'
     A                                  8  3' 4  Statistics: how much is stored-
     A                                      , and who is most active.'
     A                                  9  3' 5  Clean up: delete old read mess-
     A                                      ages, mail and log entries.'
     A                                 10  3' 6  Notice: a break message to eve-
     A                                      ry display.'
     A                                 11  3' 7 to 11  Operating system display-
     A                                      s.  These need system authority.'
     A                                 13  3'12  Start the reminder service.  T-
     A                                      his runs as a batch job called OVRE-
     A                                      MIND'
     A                                 14  3'    and sends each user a message -
     A                                      15 minutes before every timed'
     A                                 15  3'    appointment.  Start it once; i-
     A                                      t keeps running until you stop it.'
     A                                 16  3'13  Stop the reminder service.'
     A                                 23  2'Press Enter to return.'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A          R HAPURGE
     A                                  1  2'Help - Clean up old items'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  3  3'Deletes read messages and read mai-
     A                                      l older than the first number of da-
     A                                      ys,'
     A                                  4  3'and activity log entries older tha-
     A                                      n the second, for every user.'
     A                                  6  3'Unread items are never deleted.  T-
     A                                      his cannot be undone.'
     A                                 23  2'Press Enter to return.'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A          R HANOTE
     A                                  1  2'Help - Notice to every display'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  3  3'The text is sent as a break messag-
     A                                      e to every display station.'
     A                                  4  3'You need *JOBCTL special authority-
     A                                       for this to work.'
     A                                 23  2'Press Enter to return.'
